error in the application code, missing dependencies, or incorrect configuration. The empty logs suggest that the container isn't producing any output, which could be due to the application crashing immediately or the logs being redirected. \n\nSince the user has to submit the answer now, the root cause is that the 'reservation' pod's container is in a 'StartError' state, preventing the service from discovering it, leading to the absence of endpoints and missing metrics.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl logs -n hotel-reservation reservation-0"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-92de5a39e0ccf8ca', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 878, 'prompt_tokens': 9521, 'total_tokens': 10399, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfe3f-019f-7d02-97e7-b675c047d2a4-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl logs -n hotel-reservation reservation-0'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-92de5a39e0ccf8ca', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 9521, 'output_tokens': 878, 'total_tokens': 10399}), ToolMessage(content='Command Rejected: Error executing kubectl command:\nerror: error from server (NotFound): pods "reservation-0" not found in namespace "hotel-reservation"\n', id='48f36135-b324-4f15-910d-8ce9f88f19c9', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-92de5a39e0ccf8ca'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='fd99f90b-708a-4d1b-ba9c-a0095e8685fa'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let\'s try to figure out what\'s going on here. The user i